{"week": 11, "title": "Inside a media agency: strategy, automation and AI", "speaker": "Ali Coysh and Geoff Clarke", "beats": [
 {"set": "stage", "say": "Week eleven goes inside a media agency. First, Ali Coysh, National Head of Strategy at Initiative, on how media strategy works.", "board": {"photo": "photos/w11.png", "title": "Inside a **media agency**", "name": "Ali Coysh", "org": "National Head of Strategy, Initiative"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 1, "at": "aisle"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 2, "at": "aisle2"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "Ali", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Fifteen years ago, media, creative and PR agencies sat around the client. Now it's crowded with analytics and in-house teams too.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front"}, {"id": "client", "look": "exec_f", "v": 1, "at": "c", "pose": "hips"}, {"id": "a1", "look": "exec", "v": 2, "at": "l"}, {"id": "a2", "look": "exec", "v": 4, "at": "r"}, {"id": "a3", "look": "worker", "v": 1, "at": "walkL", "to": "table", "walkCue": "crowded", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "a4", "look": "exec_f", "v": 3, "at": "walkR", "to": "table2", "walkCue": "in-house", "hold": "clipboard", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "a1", "cue": "Media", "pose": "point"}, {"who": "a2", "cue": "PR", "pose": "present"}, {"who": "client", "cue": "crowded", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "nervous"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "client", "text": "So many agencies!", "cue": "crowded"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "crowded", "shot": "actor", "who": "client"}, {"cue": "in-house", "shot": "wide"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Four things drove that: more channels, the rise of specialists, economic pressure on budgets, and a data boom, along with privacy laws.", "board": {"title": "Why it **fragmented**", "steps": [{"text": "**Channels** keep multiplying", "cue": "channels"}, {"text": "**Specialists** beat generalists", "cue": "specialists"}, {"text": "**Economics** squeeze budgets", "cue": "economic"}, {"text": "**Data** boom, plus privacy laws", "cue": "data"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "boss", "look": "exec", "v": 3, "at": "table"}], "fx": [{"kind": "money", "who": "boss", "cue": "budgets"}, {"kind": "chart", "who": "host", "cue": "data"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "budgets", "shot": "two", "who": "boss"}, {"cue": "privacy", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "So who owns strategy? Creative and media agencies used to work together. Now they compete for it, both pitching to the same client.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "front", "pose": "chin"}, {"id": "cre", "look": "exec_f", "v": 5, "at": "l"}, {"id": "med", "look": "exec", "v": 6, "at": "r", "mirror": true}, {"id": "client", "look": "exec", "v": 1, "at": "c"}], "acts": [{"who": "cre", "cue": "compete", "pose": "point", "expr": "stern"}, {"who": "med", "cue": "both", "pose": "point", "expr": "stern"}, {"who": "client", "cue": "pitching", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "dazed"}], "fx": [{"kind": "question", "who": "host", "cue": "owns"}, {"kind": "say", "who": "cre", "text": "Our strategy!", "cue": "compete"}, {"kind": "say", "who": "med", "text": "No, ours!", "cue": "both"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "host"}, {"cue": "compete", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "client", "shot": "close", "who": "client"}]}, 
 {"set": "street", "say": "Media's job has grown too. It used to be planning, buying and reporting on paid media. Now it orchestrates experiences across owned, earned, shared and paid.", "board": {"title": "Media's **bigger job**", "vs": {"left": "Then", "right": "Now", "leftItems": ["Plan, buy, report", "Paid media only"], "rightItems": ["Orchestrate experiences", "Owned, earned, shared, paid"], "cue": "used"}}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "p1", "look": "shopper", "v": 3, "at": "bus", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "p2", "look": "student", "v": 4, "at": "walkR", "to": "kerb", "walkCue": "orchestrates"}], "acts": [{"who": "p1", "cue": "orchestrates", "pose": "none", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "sparkle", "who": "p1", "cue": "experiences"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "orchestrates", "shot": "wide"}]}, 
 {"set": "home", "say": "To choose channels, strategists weigh eight inputs. Who's the audience, what do they watch, what's happening in culture, and where do they shop the category?", "board": {"title": "Eight **inputs**", "lines": [{"text": "**Audience** insight", "cue": "audience"}, {"text": "**Media** consumption", "cue": "watch"}, {"text": "**Cultural** trends", "cue": "culture"}, {"text": "**Category** context", "cue": "category"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "tv", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "a", "look": "student", "v": 5, "at": "sofa", "mode": "sit", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "b", "look": "shopper", "v": 1, "at": "sofa2", "mode": "sit"}], "acts": [{"who": "b", "cue": "watch", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "eye", "who": "b", "cue": "watch"}, {"kind": "heart", "who": "a", "cue": "culture"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "watch", "shot": "actor", "who": "b"}, {"cue": "category", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Then the hard numbers. Which channel works best? What does modelling say drives return? Which markets matter, and what creative assets are there?", "board": {"title": "And four **more**", "lines": [{"text": "**Channel** effectiveness", "cue": "channel"}, {"text": "**Modelling** for ROI", "cue": "modelling"}, {"text": "**Market** nuance", "cue": "markets"}, {"text": "**Creative** considerations", "cue": "creative"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "an", "look": "worker", "v": 2, "at": "desk", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}], "fx": [{"kind": "chart", "who": "an", "cue": "modelling"}, {"kind": "bulb", "who": "host", "cue": "creative"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "modelling", "shot": "actor", "who": "an"}, {"cue": "markets", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "stage", "say": "Every decision follows one logic flow. Journey stage, then the bond or barrier, the media role, and then channel, platform and the exact environment.", "board": {"title": "The **logic flow**", "steps": [{"text": "**Journey** stage", "cue": "journey"}, {"text": "**Bond** or barrier", "cue": "bond"}, {"text": "**Media** role", "cue": "role"}, {"text": "**Channel**, then platform", "cue": "channel"}, {"text": "**Environment**", "cue": "environment"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 6, "at": "aisle"}], "acts": [{"who": "s1", "cue": "environment", "pose": "up", "expr": "grin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "bulb", "who": "s1", "cue": "environment"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "environment", "shot": "actor", "who": "s1"}]}, 
 {"set": "plaza", "say": "Take Lego City. Kids felt it was losing out to newer, cooler toys. So Lego partnered with Nitro Circus and reignited the love.", "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "r"}, {"id": "k1", "look": "kid", "v": 1, "at": "l"}, {"id": "k2", "look": "kid", "v": 2, "at": "c"}, {"id": "mum", "look": "shopper", "v": 3, "at": "far", "hold": "bag", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "k1", "cue": "losing", "pose": "shrug", "expr": "dazed"}, {"who": "k2", "cue": "cooler", "expr": "neutral"}, {"who": "k1", "cue": "Nitro", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "laugh"}, {"who": "k2", "cue": "reignited", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "k1", "text": "Bit boring now", "cue": "losing"}, {"kind": "burst", "who": "k2", "cue": "Nitro"}, {"kind": "heart", "who": "k1", "cue": "love"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "losing", "shot": "two", "who": "k1"}, {"cue": "Nitro", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "love", "shot": "close", "who": "k2"}]}, 
 {"set": "home", "say": "Crown wasn't seen as a dining destination. So it sponsored MasterChef on TV, rebuilding its dining credentials where food lovers were watching.", "board": {"title": "Crown x **MasterChef**", "lines": [{"text": "Barrier: not a **dining** spot", "cue": "dining"}, {"text": "Role: rebuild **credentials**", "cue": "credentials"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "l", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "a", "look": "elder", "v": 2, "at": "sofa", "mode": "sit"}, {"id": "b", "look": "shopper", "v": 5, "at": "sofa2", "mode": "sit"}], "acts": [{"who": "a", "cue": "MasterChef", "expr": "lick"}, {"who": "b", "cue": "watching", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "a", "text": "Dinner at Crown?", "cue": "credentials"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "MasterChef", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "food", "shot": "actor", "who": "a"}]}, 
 {"set": "street", "say": "In Queensland, locals saw NRMA as an outsider. So it teamed up with the Courier Mail on Help our highway, campaigning to fix the Bruce Highway.", "board": {"title": "Help our **highway**", "lines": [{"text": "NRMA x **Courier Mail**", "cue": "Courier"}, {"text": "Articles, polls, editorial", "cue": "campaigning"}, {"text": "Fix the **Bruce Highway**", "cue": "Bruce"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "d", "look": "worker", "v": 3, "at": "kerb", "pose": "hips"}, {"id": "e", "look": "elder", "v": 1, "at": "bus"}], "acts": [{"who": "d", "cue": "outsider", "pose": "none", "expr": "stern"}, {"who": "d", "cue": "Bruce", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "think", "who": "d", "text": "Not from here", "cue": "outsider"}, {"kind": "exclaim", "who": "e", "cue": "fix"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "outsider", "shot": "close", "who": "d"}, {"cue": "Help", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "street", "say": "It worked. NRMA hit its best non-customer consideration in Queensland in six years, and the government committed four hundred and sixty-seven million dollars.", "board": {"title": "Print felt **real**", "big": "$467m", "caption": "committed to fix the **Bruce Highway**", "cue": "four"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}, {"id": "d", "look": "worker", "v": 3, "at": "kerb"}], "acts": [{"who": "d", "cue": "committed", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "laugh"}], "fx": [{"kind": "tick", "who": "host", "cue": "worked"}, {"kind": "money", "who": "d", "cue": "million"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "host"}, {"cue": "government", "shot": "board"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Ali's answer to creative versus media? Creative and media. Insight, creativity, collaboration, and human thinking plus AI.", "board": {"title": "Creative **AND** media", "lines": [{"text": "**Insights** matter more", "cue": "Insight"}, {"text": "**Creativity** cuts through", "cue": "creativity"}, {"text": "**Collaboration** is critical", "cue": "collaboration"}, {"text": "**Human thinking** plus AI", "cue": "human"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "cre", "look": "exec_f", "v": 5, "at": "table"}, {"id": "med", "look": "exec", "v": 6, "at": "table2"}], "acts": [{"who": "cre", "cue": "collaboration", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "smile"}, {"who": "med", "cue": "human", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "heart", "who": "cre", "cue": "collaboration"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "collaboration", "shot": "wide"}]}, 
 {"set": "stage", "say": "Then Geoff Clarke, Chief Operating Officer of IPG Mediabrands Australia. ChatGPT reached about seven hundred million users in under two years, so regulation, ethics and education are playing catch-up.", "board": {"photo": "photos/w11b.png", "title": "Bots, AI and **people**", "name": "Geoff Clarke", "org": "Chief Operating Officer, IPG Mediabrands Australia"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "c", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 3, "at": "aisle", "hold": "phone", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "host", "cue": "seven", "pose": "up", "expr": "shock"}], "fx": [{"kind": "exclaim", "who": "host", "cue": "seven"}, {"kind": "clock", "who": "s1", "cue": "catch-up"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "Geoff", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "seven", "shot": "close"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Here's the false economy. Upstream work is now heavily AI driven, but downstream, seventy percent of the workload, is still highly manual.", "board": {"title": "A **false economy**", "bars": [{"label": "Upstream: AI driven", "value": 30, "display": "30%", "cue": "Upstream"}, {"label": "Downstream: manual", "value": 70, "display": "70%", "cue": "downstream"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "w", "look": "worker", "v": 4, "at": "desk", "hold": "clipboard", "pose": "hold", "expr": "dazed"}], "acts": [{"who": "w", "cue": "manual", "expr": "pained"}], "fx": [{"kind": "zzz", "who": "w", "cue": "manual"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "manual", "shot": "actor", "who": "w"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "So agencies built bots. Trigger bots react to an email, automatic bots take over next, and schedule bots run at set times. Geoff calls them an invisible police force.", "board": {"title": "Three kinds of **bots**", "steps": [{"text": "**Trigger** react to an input", "cue": "Trigger"}, {"text": "**Automatic** take over next", "cue": "automatic"}, {"text": "**Schedule** run at set times", "cue": "schedule"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "present"}, {"id": "w", "look": "worker", "v": 4, "at": "desk", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}], "acts": [{"who": "w", "cue": "police", "expr": "relief_open"}], "fx": [{"kind": "eye", "who": "host", "cue": "invisible"}, {"kind": "tick", "who": "w", "cue": "force"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "invisible", "shot": "close"}, {"cue": "force", "shot": "two", "who": "w"}]}, 
 {"set": "office", "say": "Bots now run TV setup, bookings and budget reconciliation. With offshoring, they saved about two hundred and seven thousand hours in five years, and clients became partners.", "board": {"title": "Five years of **bots**", "big": "207k", "caption": "**hours** saved with offshoring", "cue": "two"}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "cheer"}, {"id": "w", "look": "worker", "v": 4, "at": "desk", "expr": "smile"}, {"id": "cl", "look": "exec_f", "v": 2, "at": "walkR", "to": "table", "walkCue": "clients"}], "acts": [{"who": "w", "cue": "hours", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "laugh"}, {"who": "cl", "cue": "partners", "pose": "present", "expr": "smile"}], "fx": [{"kind": "stars", "who": "w", "cue": "hours"}, {"kind": "heart", "who": "cl", "cue": "partners"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "hours", "shot": "actor", "who": "w"}, {"cue": "clients", "shot": "wide"}]}, 
 {"set": "plaza", "say": "So what skills matter? Data-driven thinking, creative and strategic thinking, and adaptability. The lasting edge is the craft of your people.", "board": {"title": "Skills that **last**", "lines": [{"text": "**Data-driven** thinking", "cue": "Data"}, {"text": "**Creative** and strategic thinking", "cue": "creative"}, {"text": "**Adaptability**, lifelong learning", "cue": "adaptability"}]}, "cast": [{"id": "host", "look": "host", "at": "board", "pose": "point"}, {"id": "s1", "look": "student", "v": 7, "at": "walkR", "to": "c", "hold": "laptop", "pose": "hold"}, {"id": "s2", "look": "student", "v": 8, "at": "r"}], "acts": [{"who": "s2", "cue": "craft", "pose": "cheer", "expr": "grin"}], "fx": [{"kind": "brain", "who": "s1", "cue": "strategic"}, {"kind": "bulb", "who": "s2", "cue": "craft"}], "shots": [{"cue": "start", "shot": "board"}, {"cue": "adaptability", "shot": "wide"}, {"cue": "craft", "shot": "close", "who": "s2"}]}, 
